### Variables
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Auth - Login PIN
POST {{base}}/auth/login-pin
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+593999999999","pin":"1234"}

### Auth - Perfil
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Members - Crear plan
POST {{base}}/members/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","name":"Mensual","price":45,"duration_days":30}

### Finance - Crear cuenta bancaria
POST {{base}}/finance/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","bank_name":"Pichincha","account_number":"123456","account_holder":"GymSync"}

### Finance - Crear pago
POST {{base}}/finance/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"USER_ID","gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","amount":45,"method":"TRANSFER"}

### Marketplace - Crear producto
POST {{base}}/marketplace/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","name":"Proteina","price":42,"stock":10}

### Routines - Crear rutina
POST {{base}}/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","name":"Pierna"}

### Notifications - Enviar
POST {{base}}/notifications/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","channel":"WHATSAPP","type":"CUSTOM","content":"Hola"}

### Metrics - KPIs
GET {{base}}/metrics/kpis?gym_id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Access - Validar token
POST {{base}}/access/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","method":"QR","code_4digit":"1234"}
PY